h_text","block_id":"E/N3H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b40afb1-6d88-411f-b74f-b00d642d21dc","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u0026gt; Allowing changes to a pull request branch created from a fork\nなんで、多分そっちのmain書き換えれないようにするためにもブランチ分けた方がいいですね","ts":"1632527518.374800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uqyW9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c92df89-7ba7-4fa9-8b33-79b81d474dfb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これ手元にfetchした場合どういう扱いになるんだろう","ts":"1632527474.373900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ex5T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7200f6d3-dd2b-44ab-b9ff-b686c893dd31","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"たしかに\nどうせforkしてるし雑でいいや的な手癖が出てしまった","ts":"1632527472.373800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2XZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"067705c6-93bc-4b63-95f6-a3a2ba98ced4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"feature/unix_socket的なやつがよかったかも","ts":"1632527434.372900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xT8e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1478245b-cfa5-45c9-be93-52a33b8740b4","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あ、PR元ブランチはそうですね","ts":"1632527428.372800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lot"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b05004d-4873-4301-b685-7476a7a6cd5e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、mainからPR出されてる？","ts":"1632527405.372100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d6Ud9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"242fbe19-a775-4d4f-835d-fda65e0dc278","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"とりあえず今使ってて落ちるって事はないです","ts":"1632527399.371900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GvG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c845e40f-12b0-45a6-8889-c74fa6958fa1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"落ちることはあんまりないのかな、使っていけばいいか","ts":"1632527379.371400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ps+Ij"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c83f8e9-1b76-4c83-9af8-deff38a594d2","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"一応シェルを落としたらサーバは死にますが、ソケットはその時に掃除してくれるのでもう一度zshを立ち上げたら普通にサーバが上がるようにはなってます\nあとソケットが既にあるかどうかも検知するようにしてあるので重複起動の心配もないかと","ts":"1632527223.371000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dkk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"678d9028-535a-4577-8972-c12bdcccecf6","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"それはまだやってないですね\nパフォーマンスはいちいちdeno上げてる時よりは上がってると思ってます","ts":"1632527129.369200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LcI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05d99d96-7756-4fd4-b845-8a3901fa9003","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとパフォーマンスがどんなもんか気になっている","ts":"1632527105.368700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R4aM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a08ff0e-6c22-4b60-9274-b2f826466bb8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"挙動だけ聞いておきたいんですけど、サーバ落ちたときって勝手に再起動します？","ts":"1632527088.368000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L4n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f935ff0-25f9-48bf-9fc4-d5ba796d1b4e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"とりあえずこれをAllowにしてPR出しました","ts":"1632527054.367600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZHigz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67cb439a-e6b9-4df2-b921-954ff918af3b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"fork元のメンテナにpush権限渡すのはできそう？\n\u003chttps://docs.github.com/en/github/collaborating-with-pull-requests/working-with-forks/allowing-changes-to-a-pull-request-branch-created-from-a-fork\u003e","ts":"1632526986.367000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y8XXQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"108c1be5-d9a7-4049-becf-5f566ef30088","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"fork先か","ts":"1632526818.366000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zYS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6775e7a0-898f-457a-83a6-98f9e51e39f5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ブランチがfork元に存在するから多分pushできないですよね","ts":"1632526794.365200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pvs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cf0fe40-de0b-4e3f-8371-19938b02840b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"cherry-pick的なのができればそれでいいのと、diffもらってpatchあてるのでもできるとは思うんだけど","ts":"1632526781.364900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hf2yo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00458717-6a50-4b94-8fb9-f29966ff7383","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"forkからのPRにはレビューしか出せないかな","ts":"1632526775.364700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"olBbK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69bddf29-d9ba-4577-8f7a-a0f07dff70e8","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あー、調整するってなるとそういうのが必要になるのか","ts":"1632526744.363600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fdd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01fdf436-af19-4f3d-84cc-7b591bff6af2","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"とりあえずソケットの掃除に `SIGTERM` をトラップするんじゃなくて `window.onunload` を使うようにした","ts":"1632526726.363100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SkA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18fdbc76-55e8-4032-a24f-889737c1f046","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"手元で取り込むん